<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 02 — OUR STORY, VISION & MISSION  (pinned cinematic)
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="slide slide-pin" id="story">
  <div class="story-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/story/story-02-reach.jpg');"></div>
  <div class="story-overlay"></div>
  <div class="slide-content wrap">
    <div class="story-index"><span class="line"><span>02 — Our Story</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="story-title"><span class="line"><span>We started PSE because talent this specialized deserves more than a keyword search.</span></span></h2>
    <p class="story-text"><span class="line"><span><strong>Our Vision:</strong> to be the indispensable strategic advisory partner in the Kingdom for achieving qualitative national localization — enabling the top 1% of highly specialized Saudi female professionals to reach the roles that carry real technical and strategic weight.</span></span></p>
    <p class="story-text"><span class="line"><span><strong>Our Mission:</strong> to leverage proprietary technical and psychometric assessment frameworks that let Vision 2030 organizations identify, onboard, and sustainably retain specialized Saudi female talent — with confidence, not guesswork.</span></span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 03 — HOW WE WORK  (accordion, not pinned)
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="slide slide-flow slide-dark" id="how-we-work">
  <div class="story-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/story/story-03-stairs.jpg');"></div>
  <div class="story-overlay story-overlay-heavy"></div>
  <div class="slide-content wrap">
    <div class="story-index reveal"><span class="line"><span>03 — How We Work</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="story-title reveal"><span class="line"><span>One framework. Two audiences. Zero guesswork.</span></span></h2>
    <p class="story-text reveal" style="margin-bottom:44px;"><span class="line"><span>Open any section below for the detail behind how we work with clients and how we vet candidates.</span></span></p>

    <div class="accordion-wrap reveal">
      <div class="accordion-group">
        <div class="accordion-label">For Clients — Service Models</div>
        <details class="acc-item" open>
          <summary><span>Strategic Executive Search</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>High-level retained advisory for C-suite and director roles, requiring extreme discretion and access to the rarest female leadership talent.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Contract Staffing Advisory</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Rapid supply of specialized Saudi female talent for fixed-term projects or immediate operational capacity injection.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Permanent Placement Advisory</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Sourcing candidates for long-term, direct employment within the client's organizational structure.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-group">
        <div class="accordion-label">For Clients — Risk Mitigation</div>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Placement Guarantee</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>We offer a free replacement search if the hired candidate resigns or is terminated for performance reasons within the agreed-upon guarantee period.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Focus on Value</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>We enable compliance with qualitative localization goals, ensuring the client avoids the risk of placing an unqualified individual in a strategic role simply to meet a quota.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Built to Last</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Our lean operating model is designed for long-term stability, so our commitment to your mandate doesn't depend on deal volume.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-group">
        <div class="accordion-label">For Candidates — The PSE Differentiator</div>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Deep Technical Assessment</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>We move beyond CV filtering. Candidates are pre-vetted against industry-specific technical criteria to ensure immediate operational capability from day one.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Vision 2030 Alignment Scoring</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>We evaluate candidates' experience in Giga-Projects or their direct contribution to national KPIs, ensuring they meet the qualitative standards of the localization mandate.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="acc-item">
          <summary><span>Speed in Scarcity</span><span class="acc-plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Our continuous, focused talent pool mapping allows us to generate a viable, vetted shortlist faster than generalist firms who must start from scratch for niche requests.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 04 — OUR NUMBERS  (not pinned)
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="slide slide-flow slide-dark" id="numbers">
  <div class="story-overlay-mesh"></div>
  <div class="slide-content wrap">
    <div class="story-index reveal"><span class="line"><span>04 — By The Numbers</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="story-title reveal"><span class="line"><span>The gap is closing fast. Quality hasn't kept pace.</span></span></h2>

    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow-dark" style="color:#7FE6B8;margin-top:20px;">The Market Imperative</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><div class="stat-num">17%</div><div class="stat-label">Female labor force participation, 2017</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">36%</div><div class="stat-label">Female labor force participation, 2025</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">40%</div><div class="stat-label">Revised Vision 2030 target by decade-end</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note" style="color:#7A7E86;margin-top:10px;">Source: General Authority for Statistics (GASTAT); Vision 2030 KPI tracker, 2025.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:56px;">
      <div class="eyebrow-dark" style="color:#7FE6B8;">Our Service Standard</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><div class="stat-num">14</div><div class="stat-label">working days to first qualified shortlist</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">Top 3</div><div class="stat-label">technically proficient candidates, guaranteed</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">90</div><div class="stat-label">day replacement guarantee window</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note" style="color:#7A7E86;margin-top:10px;">Operating commitments for every engagement — not historical claims. PSE is a newly registered advisory boutique in the Kingdom.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="partnership-block reveal">
      <div class="partnership-img" style="background-image:url('/img/story/story-04-success.jpg');"></div>
      <div class="partnership-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow-dark" style="color:#7FE6B8;">The Partnership</div>
        <h3 style="color:#fff;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:24px;margin:10px 0 16px;">A fee structure built on transparency.</h3>
        <p style="color:#C4C9D2;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;">Retainer fees cover our initial resource commitment; success fees ensure clients pay only for successful, guaranteed-quality placement outcomes. No hidden costs, no misaligned incentives — just a partnership structured around the outcome you actually need.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

